Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 13:41:58 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] autotests: Every 3D mode is listed left eye first, saved
 modes are restored

virtualStereoTest and mockDisplayPortSequentialTest expect no right eye
first twin; the new testMockDrmEyeOrder saves a right eye first rows,
columns, checkerboard or frame sequential mode, with the swap on and off,
and expects the left eye first mode with the swap flipped, a saved left eye
first mode to keep its swap, and a saved frame sequential mode to be
restored.

